WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Step the feet wide, turning the toes out to about 45 degrees, heels slightly in.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Bend the knees deeply, tracking them toward the little toes; sink the hips to knee height.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Lengthen the tailbone down and lift the chest tall over the pelvis.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Bend the elbows to cactus arms, palms forward, and hold with a steady gaze.
